    <node id="Cedar Grove Media">
      <data key="d0">Cedar Grove Media</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Cedar Grove Media is an organization identified as the payer, located at 77 Media Row, Burbank, CA 91502. It is also recognized as the organization billed for services, including brand identity revision and content strategy workshop services. The entity received invoices with the numbers PRIYA-CEDARGROVE-003 and PRIYA-CEDARGROVE-005, indicating its role as a client organization that has contracted services from Priya Raman. Cedar Grove Media is further described as a client organization located at the same address, which has engaged in services provided by Priya Raman. Additionally, it is noted as a merchant that made a payment of $2,600.00 on January 2, 2025, from Priya Raman's account. These descriptions collectively highlight Cedar Grove Media's role as both a payer and a client in financial and service-related transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;A merchant or business entity that made a payment to Priya Raman's account.&lt;SEP&gt;A merchant that processed a payment of $2,600.00 from Priya Raman's account.&lt;SEP&gt;A merchant that made a payment to Priya Raman's account on 2025-04-02.&lt;SEP&gt;A merchant or business entity that made a payment of $2,600.00 to Priya Raman's account on 2025-05-02.</data>
