      <data key="d2">David Okafor is an individual associated with multiple financial and contractual roles. He is identified as a recipient with the address 4127 Maple Hollow Dr, Austin, TX 78745, and is listed as the recipient in a 1099-NEC form, indicating he received nonemployee compensation. Additionally, he is recognized as the invoice issuer, with the same address, and is also an account holder and invoice issuer. David Okafor is an individual account holder who issued an invoice with the number DAVID-HALCYON-005. He is associated with a checking account ending in 5567 at NORTHWIND BANK and is a member of Cascade Credit Union, holding a checking account with the institution. These details collectively illustrate his involvement in financial transactions and contractual obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;An account holder associated with the checking account ending in 5567 at NORTHWIND BANK.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of Cascade Credit Union, associated with a checking account and various financial transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The account holder associated with the checking account ending in 5567, residing at 4127 Maple Hollow Dr, Austin, TX 78745.</data>
