      <data key="d2">Nimbus Analytics LLC is a company located at 900 Innovation Pkwy Suite 400, Jersey City, NJ 07302. It is identified as both a payer and an employer in various contexts. The organization is noted as the employer of Marcus Chen, and it issued his pay statement. Nimbus Analytics LLC made two payroll deposits to Marcus Chen's account during the statement period, with specific dates recorded as 2025-02-02 and 2025-02-16, as well as 2025-04-02 and 2025-04-16. These payments are also described as occurring on two occasions during the statement period, highlighting its role in payroll processing for Marcus Chen. Additionally, Nimbus Analytics LLC is associated with contract payments related to David Okafor's account. It received a contract payment of $2,040.00 from David Okafor's account and made a contract payment of the same amount to his account on 2025-03-02. Another description notes that the company made a contract payment of $2,040.00 to David Okafor's account on 2025-05-02, which may indicate a recurring or multiple payment activity. These descriptions collectively highlight its role as an employer and a financial entity involved in both payroll and contract payments.</data>
