      <data key="d2">Marcus Chen is an employee of Nimbus Analytics LLC, as indicated by multiple pay statements associated with his account. He received pay statements for several periods in 2025, including January 24 to February 6, February 21 to March 6, March 21 to April 3, April 18 to May 1, May 16 to May 29, and June 13 to June 26. These records suggest a continuous employment period with the company, with regular payroll cycles. Additionally, Marcus Chen is identified as an account holder associated with a checking account ending in 4021 at NORTHWIND BANK. His residential address is listed as 218 Larkspur Lane, Astoria, NY 11106, which is linked to his earnings statement. The information provided collectively outlines his employment status, financial accounts, and residential details, offering a comprehensive overview of his professional and personal context.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of Cascade Credit Union with a checking account, residing at 218 Larkspur Lane, Astoria, NY 11106.&lt;SEP&gt;An account holder associated with the checking account ending in 4021 at NORTHWIND BANK.&lt;SEP&gt;An account holder associated with the account ****7788 at Northwind Bank, residing at 218 Larkspur Lane, Astoria, NY 11106.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of Cascade Credit Union with a savings account, residing at 218 Larkspur Lane, Astoria, NY 11106.&lt;SEP&gt;An account holder at Northwind Bank with a Savings account ending in 7788.&lt;SEP&gt;An account holder associated with the account ****7788 at Northwind Bank.</data>
