    <node id="Whole Foods Market">
      <data key="d0">Whole Foods Market</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Whole Foods Market is a retail store and grocery store chain that has been associated with various financial transactions involving customer accounts. The entity has been linked to multiple instances where it either charged or made payments to accounts, including those of David Okafor, Marcus Chen, and Priya Raman. For David Okafor, Whole Foods Market has recorded several transactions, such as a charge of $88.71 on 2025-03-09 and another of $81.33 on 2025-05-21, both resulting in debits to his account. Additionally, the store has been noted to have made a payment of $117.67 from his account. These transactions suggest that Whole Foods Market has engaged in both charging and crediting activities related to David Okafor's account.

Separately, Whole Foods Market has also been associated with Marcus Chen, where a purchase transaction of $-62.90 was recorded from his checking account on 2025-02-23. Another instance mentions that Marcus Chen made a purchase at the store, resulting in a debit to his account. Additional records indicate that Marcus Chen made purchases resulting in debits of $108.41 on 2025-04-04 and on May 5, 2025. These interactions indicate that Whole Foods Market has served as a point of sale for multiple customers, with varying financial impacts on their accounts. The store's involvement in these transactions highlights its role as a commercial entity that facilitates retail and grocery purchases, with corresponding financial records maintained for each transaction.

Whole Foods Market has also been linked to Priya Raman, with a charge of $49.24 recorded on January 6, 2025, to her account. The store made a payment withdrawal from Priya Raman's account and processed a payment of $62.90 from her account. These transactions further illustrate the store's engagement in financial activities with multiple customers, reflecting its function as a retail and grocery store chain that interacts with various accounts through charges, payments, and withdrawals.&lt;SEP&gt;A retail store where Priya Raman made a purchase on 2025-04-05.&lt;SEP&gt;A grocery store that charged $63.10 to Priya Raman's account on 2025-05-12.&lt;SEP&gt;A retail store that charged a fee to Priya Raman's account.</data>
