      <data key="d2">CVS Pharmacy is a pharmacy chain that has been associated with various financial transactions involving different individuals. It is noted that CVS Pharmacy charged $70.36 to David Okafor's account on May 10, 2025, and made a payment to his account at a later date. These transactions resulted in a debit to David Okafor's account, indicating that he made a purchase at the pharmacy. 

Additionally, CVS Pharmacy was linked to transactions involving Marcus Chen. On February 13, 2025, the pharmacy made a purchase transaction of $-73.19 from Marcus Chen's checking account, and on May 13, 2025, Marcus Chen made a purchase at the pharmacy, which resulted in a debit to his account. The pharmacy also made a withdrawal from Marcus Chen's account, suggesting further financial interactions.

CVS Pharmacy also processed a payment of $28.79 from Priya Raman's account and charged her $166.48 on January 6, 2025. These transactions highlight the pharmacy's role in various financial activities, including both debits and credits to customer accounts. Overall, the entity appears to be involved in multiple transactions with different individuals, reflecting its role as a retail pharmacy chain.&lt;SEP&gt;A pharmacy where Priya Raman made a purchase on 2025-04-22.&lt;SEP&gt;A pharmacy service provider that charged $25.40 to Priya Raman's account on 2025-05-03.</data>
